Anime
An anime adaptation was announced on September 10, 2024. It was later revealed to be a television series that will be produced by Atra and directed by Hiroshi Shirai, with series composition handled by Aya Satsuki, characters designed by Yoshiko Saitō and Yūta Ōtaka, and music composed by Kohta Yamamoto. It is set to premiere in 2026, and will run for two consecutive cours.
Reception
By September 2024, the series had over 400,000 copies in circulation.
